<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear Partner:</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Recently, we notified you about a number of potential business opportunities that came from your partnership with Intel. Our records indicate that you have not yet followed up on some of these leads.</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Here are the leads that are awaiting your action:</font></div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(Lead.FirstBucket)(Lead.SecondBucket)(Lead.ThirdBucket)&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://partners.intel.com/">Click here to access these leads now</a></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">For training or support on how to handle these contacts, visit the&nbsp;</span><a href="https://partners.seek.intel.com/SupportPage" style="font-size: 12pt;">Intel partner support page</a></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for acting on these past-due contacts. We look forward to sending additional qualified leads your way.</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNoSpacing" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1">Copyright © 2016 Intel Corporation. All rights reserved. Intel and the Intel logo, are trademarks of Intel Corporation in the U.S. and/or other countries.</font></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 7.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1">